# Cart

```ad-state
id: h858678918c
count: 2
price: 5
tags: ["mug","oven"]
total: {count + price}

```

```ad-action?name=cart.add&on:click
id: h15d4cce789
role: primary
args: {"sku":"oven-12l"}
---
Add {count} items

```

```ad-region
id: h68ce0e96f9
when: {count > 0}
---
{total} in the cart

```

```ad-text
id: h4a559166bc
each: "item in tags"
body: {item}

```

You owe {total} dollars.
